Everything in the song is included in this tab.
It is hard to perform because there is 4 guitars
playing at one time and at one point there is even
a fifth, but can easily be pulled off with two
guitars with some improvising.

Standard tuning.

h= Hammer-on
p= Pull off
/= Slide

